{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_033680","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你们把格瓦拉叫作“El Che”啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不只是我们。这一带大家都这么叫。本来“Che”就是他的绰号，用姓来叫太生硬了吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":"AUX_REGIONAL_USAGE_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"……第一次见到你的时候，我吓了一跳。因为你很像他。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"我像“El Che”？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"总觉得有点像。不是长相，而是那种气质吧……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"对<R=FSLN,Sandinista>来说，格瓦拉也是英雄吗？","cn_control_tokens":"<R=FSLN,Sandinista>","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_LATIN_READING"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"当然。<R=FSLN,Sandinista>本来就是因为认同El Che和Fidel的思想才成立的。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=FSLN,Sandinista>","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_LATIN_READING"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"Fidel……Fidel Castro吗。也就是说，你们想在尼加拉瓜实现古巴革命。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"本来是这样。可现在的古巴已经和最初不同了……自从El Che离开以后。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"JPN_CUBA_CHANGED_SINCE_CHE_LEFT_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"El Che是真正的革命家。他为人民而战，也为人民而死。他比任何人都努力，也坚守道德。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":"AUX_WORK_AND_MORALITY_DETAILS_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"即使当上古巴的部长，他也会放弃休息日去参加农活和土木工程。而且还是自愿劳动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":"AUX_VOLUNTEER_DETAIL_REJOINED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"这件事我也听说过。但那种过于纯粹的作风，不也可以说把格瓦拉自己逼入了绝境吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":"JPN_FASTIDIOUS_PURITY_NUANCE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"什么意思？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"不是每个人都能像他那样成为超人。但他认为，自己在古巴坚持的理想到了玻利维亚也同样行得通。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"结果他既没能聚集到人手，也没能得到农民的支持，最后丢了性命。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"JPN_PERSONNEL_AND_PEASANT_SUPPORT_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"这……也许是吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":"AUX_YOU_ARE_RIGHT_ADDITION_REMOVED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"但至少，无论多么艰难，他都没有从农民手里抢东西。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"这点我同意。毕竟有不少游击队嘴上喊着革命，实际上却像强盗一样掠夺民众。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"JPN_BANDIT_COMPARISON_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"要是有他那样的<R=领导者,comandante>，<R=FSLN,Sandinista>的士气应该也会高涨吧。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=领导者,comandante> <R=FSLN,Sandinista>","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_LATIN_READINGS;AUX_WILL_TO_FIGHT_PARAPHRASE_REPLACED_BY_JPN_MORALE"}]}